 "structural_change": "NEW leaf (ELEM-CENSUS 10-16, census class F, Q-COMPUTE-DIE go 10-16): compute-die system face qfd_sys_face (Q-NETLIST ab5f73bcc/c9415e73d/3effaa228: config ROM ot_rom_4096x72_m8 boot + program replay, static T/L/E calendars, qfd_d2d_cal_seq, record port, embedding row RX, STATUS/RESULT, fab), CONTRACT v1.4 frame 302.4 x 216 um, one ck root. Recipe 3: every data input and output registered at its pin (+1 edge in, +1 edge out, pin_regs.json; the compiled calendar offsets absorb it). Synthesis-only RTL guard: the ROM instance drops its VIAMAP/INSTANCE parameters under SYNTHESIS (OpenROAD's netlist reader rejects instance parameters; the hard macro is content-independent), simulation unchanged. Pin FACES = the die tool's top-down q2o1 assignment (N D2D/record/STATUS face, S sequencer/TT/native59 face, W embedding-provider + TT pw face); 'fault' (absent from the die file: unloaded at die level, folded into fab inside) on S. Ports spread over each face; q2o2 face moves are a re-kit only.",
 "slot_change_request": "none: CONTRACT.md v1.4 frame 302.4 x 216 (results/arch/qwen_split_compute_1014/CONTRACT.md:39); config ROM beside the N-face clock entry, over the boot/replay logic (gate 1: ROM at the E edge -> macro->reg -50 ps diagnostic).",
